        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker is actively fighting to ensure strong Buy American policies are included in the bipartisan infrastructure framework and budget bill.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Global competition makes domestic production necessary for national security and economic resilience.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Republicans from intensive manufacturing states have supported Buy American policies and reforms for years.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The pandemic increased public awareness of the importance of self-reliance in manufacturing.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
