      {
        "text": "Public expectations for infrastructure progress have increased significantly compared to previous years.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "A bipartisan agreement in the Senate is both possible and necessary for final passage of the infrastructure bill.",
        "confidence": 0.86
